And those six pilots had to be cleaned constantly all day. And to clean those pilots, we had to have goggles. And we had leather, long leather gloves.

[PAUSES FOR 5 SECONDS]

And that was it. And the heat from the top was unbearable, from the-- from the-- from those things, from the-- what they had to be cleaned and had to burn. They had to burn. They had to burn.

I call them pilots. I don't know what they were. And on the bottom, there was cold air coming. There was-- what do you call those?

