I haven't seen her before. I don't know. That was our camp. And I knew everybody. She came by me. She looked like crazy, her hair down, and the eyes wild.

And she went by me and started choking me and hitting my head at the wall of the train. And said because of you, because of you I am going to the gas chambers. Because you did it all. You did it all. And she was hitting me and hitting me.

