So they talked amongst them. They come over and give me-- bring me, one brings me a orange. The other brings me a sandwich.

And they put it on my lap, where I was sitting. And one asks if I want water. And I said, yes, water now, water.

And they were talking amongst themselves with that guy. And this guy was working for the Germans, the Gestapo. And he is a Czech. Well, I don't know nothing.

So I-- they talk to him, they talk to me. And-- and-- and I said the name. And then they started asking me again, what did you say your name was? And I forgot.

