INT: Wait, in English?

EK: I came out such a long time already, from the office. I want to see the machine you're using, the typewriter.

INT: You said that to him?

EK: Yeah. And I called the name. I wanted the name. I didn't know. And I've seen Natalie. Natalie, I knew already, Knab.

He asked me again. And I-- and I didn't know. I didn't know. I bent over his uniform. I dared so many things I would never dared in my life. I didn't know then that I am daring. I had to do something.

