Oh, this guy gets up. And he takes all the food that I had there. He takes it. I didn't take it. He took it from me. I think he took a bag and put it in. And we go out from there.

And I say, since he-- [GERMAN SPEECH] Are you German? Are you Czech? He says, [GERMAN SPEECH]? Why do you want to know that? And [GERMAN SPEECH].

[GERMAN SPEECH]. Who are you? I want to know. Why do you want to know? Why do I want to know?

Do you know that the Germans are losing the war? Germans lost the war, and the Russians are coming. Do you know that?

