EK: And they-- the children were very happy, and they told Mamika, Mommy, it doesn't itch anymore. But you have to clean the bed out too-- the children. And I told her too, but she says, don't worry. Don't worry.

Then they were going-- the husband and wife-- were going out every day to sell goods. They told me to sell-- to sell different things, like pins and needles and threads. And-- and they came home with chickens.

[PAUSES FOR 3 SECONDS]

I wondered. They don't work. They don't go to work-- not him, not her. Where it come the chickens from?

And they told-- showed me how to-- how to clean the chickens within hot water, and how to cut up, and how to do this, and how to do that. And they would-- started cooking. Every day they cooked.

And they started giving me every day a quarter of a chicken to eat. Until then I was starving all the time. So every day I had a quarter. But they always gave me the one-- the same. But I didn't care.

[PAUSES FOR 3 SECONDS]

And they're going again selling. They going selling. I washed the floors. I washed the pots. I scraped the-- whatever there was, everything was spick and span-- beautiful.

One day, I am home cleaning the floor. I was still cleaning that floor. And they went out. And the younger Vena, the youngest son from the gypsies, comes into the house.

I have to tell you the whole story. If not, it's not gonna be a story. Comes into the house-- 'Heda?'-- to me. And Vena, [NON-ENGLISH]? What are you doing here?

[PAUSES FOR 6 SECONDS]

Yeah. Says, [NON-ENGLISH]. I want to go to bed with you. I said, I kill you, and I kill me, and I kill all the children if you don't get out this very minute from this house. Out! And if Mamika [NON-ENGLISH].

He got scared. I don't know how old he was-- maybe 15, 16 years old. [PAUSES FOR 3 SECONDS] He ran. He had money to come here. He had money to go back. He ran.

I was scared already like a-- and then I told his sister. I had to tell it. Sister told the mother. They telephone to each other. And the mother supposedly wanted to kill him, really kill him.

INT: Did you say they telephoned to each other?

EK: They did.

