EK: OK. [NON-ENGLISH]? He had-- had doors-- she had a big room and then a little, like, a side something. Except this was in the other town-- the other town by the sister, not by the mother. And a big room, and a big beds to there, where her and her husband slept on. And I slept with the three kids.

